  m_text: '<b>Additional Movement</b>

    <b>Full Stop</b>

    - This button is
    handy for slowing the ship down and stoping in place. It may take a turn to come
    to a complete stop.

    <b>Rotate Towards</b>

    - This button is used when
    your ship has a target. It will rotate your ship towards the target. More in
    the next tutorial.

