  m_text: '<b>Fine Tuning Widgets</b>


    - Often you''ll find yourself in situations
    where precise rotation is required. Orient your ship using the shapes next to
    the ship postiion preview.

    - <b><color=#ff0000>Red Arrow</color></b> Roll
    the ship

    - <b><color=#ffff00>Yellow Arrows</color></b> Control the elevation
    of the ship

    - <b><color=#00ffff>Blue Circle</color></b> tweaks the pitch
    and yaw of the ship.'
