    <b>1) Move and Turn</b>

    - Allows your ship
    to turn and move in the direction it''s facing.

    <b>2) Move and Slide</b>

    -
    Allows you to face one direction while moving in any direction.

    <b>3) Boost</b>

    -
    Allows double movement distance, with no rotation.

