  m_text: '<b>Movement</b>


    - <b>Select Movement Mode</b> to begin movement.
    <b><color=#00ffff>Left Mouse Click</b></color> on the green movement plane to
    move in any direction.

    - Under the movement panel, there are three types
    of movement:

    1) Move and Turn

    2) Move and Slide

    3) Boost

'
